PLACE YOUR RESUME HERE
======================

This file is a placeholder.  Please replace it with your actual resume:

  config/resume.pdf

Steps:
  1. Copy your resume PDF into this folder:
       cp ~/path/to/your/resume.pdf config/resume.pdf

  2. Verify the path matches the value in config/profile.yaml:
       resume:
         path: "config/resume.pdf"

  3. Delete this placeholder file once your resume is in place.

Note: The resume is read by the AI resume parser (agent/ai/resume_parser.py)
using PyMuPDF and Google Gemini to extract structured information such as
skills, work experience, education, and total years of experience.
